<h1>Capture Sphere</h1>
<hr align="left" width="98.974%" size="6" class="whs3">
<p class="Description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> Capture Sphere allows a datum sphere to be captured using the localiser probe or to be extracted by scanning using the sensor. It is used to measure spherical objects and to obtain their centres. This command is accessible from the Localiser Menu Datum &gt; Sphere.</p>
<h2><span lang="EN-GB"><span lang="EN-GB"><span lang="EN-GB"><span lang="EN-US">W</span></span></span>izard</span></h2>
<p><span lang="EN-US">When you select</span> <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Datum &gt; Sphere</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">from the localiser menu the wizard behaves depending on the settings in <a href="../../References/Preferences_-_Datums_-_Capture_Method.htm">System &gt; Preferences &gt; Datums &gt; Capture Method (Datum Capture Method)</a> dialog. If Sphere listbox is set to</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Prompt</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">the following dialogue will appear:</span></p>
<p><img src="../Capture_files/capture_method.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US">At this stage there are offered 2 possibilities for measuring the sphere:</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">If you select<span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Tactile</b></span>, you will capture the sphere using the localiser probe. See <a href="#Capture_Sphere_Wizard">Capture Sphere Wizard</a>.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">If you select <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Scanning</b></span>, you will scan the sphere using the sensor. See <a href="#Scan_Sphere_Wizard">Scan Sphere Wizard</a>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>&#160;</p>
<h3><span lang="EN-US"><a name="Capture_Sphere_Wizard"></a>Capture Sphere Wizard</span></h3>
<p>When Tactile is selected, the following dialogue will appear:</p>
<p><img src="../Capture_files/capture_sphere0.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'</b></span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button at least four times to collect the necessary points. Hold</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'B'</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to delete the last captured point if necessary. Press</span> <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'A'</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to finish.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">If Tolerance check is enabled and the next point is out-of-tolerance KUBE will play warning sound and will display out-of-tolerance value in yellow. See <a href="../../References/Preferences_-_Datums_-_Form_Tolerances.htm">System &gt; Preferences &gt; Datums &gt; Form Tolerances</a> for details.</span></p>
<p class="Warning"><span lang="EN-GB">A sphere cannot be created if less than four points were captured. In this case a warning message will appear.</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Select the side of the sphere ('</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>A'</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">- inner side or</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'B'</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">- outer side) &#160;from which the points were captured</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><img src="../Capture_files/capture_sphere.gif" width="817px" height="136px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">If the ball probe is used, it will inflate or deflate the sphere with the radius of the probe depending on which side is captured. This is very important for the correct sphere diameter because every localiser returns co-ordinates of the centre of its probe. See</span> <u><span lang="EN-GB"><a href="offset_on_curved_surfaces.htm">Offset On Curved Surfaces</a></span></u> <span lang="EN-GB">for details</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">KUBE will fit a sphere from the set of the captured points. The following information about the resulting sphere will be displayed:</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">co-ordinates of the sphere centre.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">radius (diameter) of the sphere.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">RMS of the extraction.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP228885649" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../Capture_files/capture_sphere_2.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Press '<span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>A'</b></span> button to reject the resulting sphere or '<span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>B</b></span>' button to create it.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">After finishing the capture procedure, KUBE will issue a dialog, asking you if you will continue capturing spheres.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a2" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP239339736" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../Capture_files/continue.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to exit the capture mode or '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to continue capturing using</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Tactile</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">method.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Bullet">&#160;</p>
<h3><span lang="EN-GB"><a name="Scan_Sphere_Wizard"></a>Scan</span> <span lang="EN-US">Sphere Wizard</span></h3>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">When</span> <span lang="EN-GB" class="Path" style="font-style:normal;">Scanning</span> <span class="Path" style="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal;">is selected</span><span lang="EN-GB">, an additional window (which displays the scanned data) will pop-up and the following dialogue will appear:</span></p>
<p><img src="../Capture_files/scan_sphere.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'B'</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to start scanning. Scanning is performed as in the normal</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>Scan</u></span> <span lang="EN-GB">mode, i.e. after you press</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'B'</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">button KUBE starts capturing a patch and after you press it again KUBE will stop scanning and will enter in</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>Pause</u></span> <span lang="EN-GB">mode.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a7" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP229157975" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../Capture_files/scan_sphere1.gif" width="1152px" height="834px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">W</span>hen done with the scanning press <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'A'</b></span> button to exit.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>If the extraction is successful you will get:</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">co-ordinates of the sphere centre.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">radius (diameter) of the sphere.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">RMS of the extraction.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Note" id="p3"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note</b></span>: Sphere detection is controlled by <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Tolerance</b></span> parameter. See <span lang="EN-GB"><a href="../../References/Preferences_-_Datums_-_Detection_Tolerances.htm">System &gt; Preferences &gt; Datums &gt; Detection Tolerances</a> for details.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a5" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP83876185" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../Capture_files/scan_sphere2.gif" width="1152px" height="834px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to reject the resulting sphere or '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to create it.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">After finishing the scan procedure, KUBE will issue a dialog, asking you if you will continue scanning sphere.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a6" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP228093625" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../Capture_files/continue.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to exit the capture mode or '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to continue capturing using</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Scanning</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">method.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
